<div class="row justify-content-center"><div class="col-lg-8"><div class="eyebrow">About Alzikrayat</div><h1 class="display-5 fw-bold mt-2">A small archive for meaningful moments.</h1><p class="lead text-secondary mt-4">Alzikrayat is an individual Advanced Web Technologies project demonstrating how a photo-sharing experience can be built from first principles.</p><div class="panel p-4 mt-4"><h2 class="h5">Architecture</h2><p class="text-secondary mb-0">The application separates presentation, application, and data concerns through a custom MVC structure. It uses a regular-expression Manual Router, PDO prepared statements, secure sessions, password hashing, ownership checks, and a normalized MySQL schema.</p></div></div></div>
